msgid "ReliefWord"
msgstr "ReliefWord"

msgid ""
"ReliefWord 是 ReliefOS Xorg 桌面内置的 C++17 / FLTK 文字处理器。可以从开始菜单的办公应用分类启动，也可以运行 "
"``reliefword [文档.rword | 文本.txt | 页面.html]``。Fileman 默认用它打开 ``.rword``；TXT 和"
" HTML 继续采用现有文件关联，也可以在 ReliefWord 内导入。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefWord is a C++17 / FLTK word processor built into the ReliefOS Xorg "
"desktop. Launch it from the Start menu's office applications category or run"
" ``reliefword [文档.rword | 文本.txt | 页面.html]``. Fileman opens ``.rword`` with"
" it by default; TXT and HTML retain their existing associations and can also"
" be imported within ReliefWord."

msgid "编辑与排版"
msgstr "Editing and Layout"

msgid ""
"直接点击白纸输入文字，拖动选择内容。中文显示使用系统字体，中文输入由 Xorg 会话输入法提供，也支持 UTF-8 "
"剪贴板。左右键和删除按组合字符移动；当前覆盖常见组合符、变体选择符、emoji 修饰符、ZWJ 和地区标志序列，不提供完整的双向文字排版。"
msgstr ""
"Click the white page to type and drag to select. Chinese display uses system"
" fonts, Chinese input comes from the Xorg session's input method, and UTF-8 "
"clipboard is supported. Left/right movement and deletion operate on combined"
" characters, currently covering common combining marks, variation selectors,"
" emoji modifiers, ZWJ sequences, and regional-indicator flag sequences. Full"
" bidirectional text layout is not provided."

msgid ""
"“开始”功能区提供剪贴板、字体族、字号、粗体、斜体、下划线、删除线、文字颜色和高亮。字号可选择或输入 6–96 磅，输入后按 Enter "
"应用。正文、标题、标题 1 和标题 2 "
"预设可以快速整理文档。段落支持左、中、右、两端对齐，以及项目符号、编号和缩进；“段落”对话框可以设置首行缩进、段前段后间距和行距。"
msgstr ""
"The Home ribbon provides clipboard, font family, size, bold, italic, "
"underline, strikethrough, text color, and highlighting. Choose or enter 6–96"
" pt and press Enter to apply. Body, Title, Heading 1, and Heading 2 presets "
"organize documents quickly. Paragraphs support left, center, right, and "
"justified alignment, bullets, numbering, and indentation. The Paragraph "
"dialog sets first-line indent, spacing before/after, and line spacing."

msgid ""
"“页面布局”设置 A4、Letter 或自定义纸张、横竖方向、页边距、页眉页脚与页码。在页眉或页脚使用 ``{page}`` "
"插入当前页号。Ctrl+Enter 插入分页符。“视图”提供标尺、25–300% "
"缩放和适应宽度；Ctrl+鼠标滚轮也可缩放。状态栏显示页数、非空白字符数、词数和缩放比例；中文按汉字统计词数。"
msgstr ""
"Page Layout sets A4, Letter, or custom paper, orientation, margins, "
"headers/footers, and page numbers. Use ``{page}`` in headers or footers for "
"the current page number. Ctrl+Enter inserts a page break. View provides a "
"ruler, 25–300% zoom, and Fit Width; Ctrl+mouse wheel also zooms. The status "
"bar shows pages, nonwhitespace characters, words, and zoom. Chinese word "
"counts count Han characters."

msgid "常用快捷键："
msgstr "Common shortcuts:"

msgid "操作：新建 / 打开 / 保存 / 另存为; 快捷键：Ctrl+N / O / S / Shift+S"
msgstr ""
"Action: New / Open / Save / Save As; Shortcut: Ctrl+N / O / S / Shift+S"

msgid "操作：撤销 / 重做; 快捷键：Ctrl+Z / Y"
msgstr "Action: Undo / Redo; Shortcut: Ctrl+Z / Y"

msgid "操作：剪切 / 复制 / 粘贴 / 仅粘贴文字; 快捷键：Ctrl+X / C / V / Shift+V"
msgstr ""
"Action: Cut / Copy / Paste / Paste Text Only; Shortcut: Ctrl+X / C / V / "
"Shift+V"

msgid "操作：全选 / 查找 / 替换 / 下一个匹配; 快捷键：Ctrl+A / F / H / F3"
msgstr ""
"Action: Select All / Find / Replace / Next Match; Shortcut: Ctrl+A / F / H /"
" F3"

msgid "操作：粗体 / 斜体 / 下划线; 快捷键：Ctrl+B / I / U"
msgstr "Action: Bold / Italic / Underline; Shortcut: Ctrl+B / I / U"

msgid "操作：左对齐 / 居中 / 右对齐 / 两端对齐; 快捷键：Ctrl+L / E / R / J"
msgstr ""
"Action: Align Left / Center / Right / Justify; Shortcut: Ctrl+L / E / R / J"

msgid "操作：分页符; 快捷键：Ctrl+Enter"
msgstr "Action: Page Break; Shortcut: Ctrl+Enter"

msgid "操作：文档开头 / 末尾; 快捷键：Ctrl+Home / End"
msgstr "Action: Document Start / End; Shortcut: Ctrl+Home / End"

msgid "文件菜单中的“示例文档”展示中文报告、标题和列表。功能区宽于窗口时可以横向滚动，窗口最小为 860×540。"
msgstr ""
"Sample Document in the File menu demonstrates Chinese reports, headings, and"
" lists. The ribbon scrolls horizontally when wider than the window; minimum "
"window size is 860×540."

msgid "文件格式"
msgstr "File Formats"

msgid ""
"``.rword`` 是完整保存文字、字符样式、段落、页面设置、标题和作者的原生格式。版本 1 使用小端二进制：16 字节头记录 ``RWOR`` "
"标识、版本、标志和负载长度；随后保存元信息、页面、样式表、带样式索引的 Unicode 字符及段落表。读取时校验版本、长度、Unicode "
"标量、索引、段落边界和数值范围，失败保留当前文档。"
msgstr ""
"``.rword`` is the native format preserving all text, character styles, "
"paragraphs, page settings, title, and author. Version 1 is little-endian "
"binary: a 16-byte header records the ``RWOR`` identifier, version, flags, "
"and payload length, followed by metadata, pages, style tables, Unicode "
"characters with style indexes, and a paragraph table. Reading checks "
"versions, lengths, Unicode scalars, indexes, paragraph boundaries, and "
"numeric ranges; failure preserves the current document."

msgid ""
"TXT 使用 UTF-8，接受可选 BOM，并规范化 CRLF/CR 换行；导出保留文字与分页控制字符，丢弃字体、段落和页面设置。HTML "
"支持格式化文字、标题、段落、列表、常见字体样式和预格式化文字等子集。脚本和外部资源不会执行或下载；链接地址、表格、图片等无法完整保存的内容会触发导入提示。导入后应保存为新的"
" ``.rword``；导出使用另一个文件，避免覆盖导入来源。HTML 不是完整网页或 Microsoft Word 文件兼容格式。"
msgstr ""
"TXT uses UTF-8, accepts an optional BOM, and normalizes CRLF/CR newlines. "
"Export retains text and page-break control characters but discards font, "
"paragraph, and page settings. HTML supports a subset including formatted "
"text, headings, paragraphs, lists, common font styles, and preformatted "
"text. Scripts and external resources are neither executed nor downloaded; "
"content that cannot be preserved completely, such as link destinations, "
"tables, and images, triggers an import notice. Save imports as a new "
"``.rword``; export to another file to avoid overwriting the source. HTML is "
"not a full web-page or Microsoft Word compatibility format."

msgid ""
"每份文档最多 500,000 个 Unicode 标量、50,000 个段落、512 种字符样式；分页视图最多 4,096 页，单个外来文件最多 16 "
"MiB。超过分页上限或行高无法容纳在页面时，会显示排版错误；可以撤销格式修改或调整页面设置。首版不提供 DOC/DOCX、表格、图片、宏、打印或 PDF"
" 导出。"
msgstr ""
"Each document allows at most 500,000 Unicode scalars, 50,000 paragraphs, and"
" 512 character styles. Paginated view is limited to 4,096 pages; an external"
" file to 16 MiB. Exceeding the page limit or a line height that cannot fit "
"on a page produces a layout error; undo formatting changes or adjust page "
"settings. The first version offers no DOC/DOCX, tables, images, macros, "
"printing, or PDF export."

msgid "保存与恢复"
msgstr "Saving and Recovery"

msgid ""
"保存先写同目录临时文件并同步，然后替换目标；目标被外部修改时，可以取消、另存副本或明确替换。每 60 "
"秒为修改后的文档写独立恢复副本。下次无文件参数启动时，可以恢复、稍后处理或丢弃；其他活跃实例持锁的副本不会被接管。恢复后需要另存文档，恢复副本不代替正式保存。"
msgstr ""
"Saving writes and syncs a same-directory temporary file, then replaces the "
"target. If the target was externally modified, cancel, save a copy, or "
"explicitly replace it. Modified documents get separate recovery copies every"
" 60 seconds. On the next launch without a file argument, restore, defer, or "
"discard them; copies locked by other active instances are not taken over. "
"Recovered documents must be saved separately, and recovery copies do not "
"replace normal saving."

msgid ""
"恢复目录为 ``$XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefword/recovery``；未设置时使用 "
"``$HOME/.local/state/reliefword/recovery``。"
msgstr ""
"The recovery directory is ``$XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefword/recovery``, or "
"``$HOME/.local/state/reliefword/recovery`` when unset."
